  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Piggy Gift.png|200px|left|Piggy Gift|link=Special:FilePath/Piggy Gift.png]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |holly = 10\n |level = 25\n |time = 10m\n |source = {{Infoicon|giftwrappings|bigger|link=Gift Wrapping Station}}\n |xp = 85\n |dia = 2\n |time3 = 8m\n}}\n\n'''Piggy Gift''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 25. It's a special item used only for the Christmas event. In 2025, it is unlocked at [[experience]] level 75.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making Piggy Gifts'''===\n[[File:Gift Wrapping Station 2024.png|150px|left|Gift Wrapping Station 2024|link=Special:FilePath/Gift_Wrapping_Station 2024.png]]\nPiggy Gifts are made in the [[Gift Wrapping Station]].\n\nTo make a piggy gift in the Christmas 2024 event, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Chili Popcorn.png|75px|Chili Popcorn|link=Chili Popcorn]]\n|[[File:Cherry.png|75px|Cherry|link=Cherry]]\n|[[File:Egg.png|75px|Egg|link=Egg]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\n\nIt takes 10 minutes to make one gift, and 8 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] station. Each gift gives players 85 [[experience]] points.\n\nTo make a piggy gift in the '''Christmas 2025 event''', players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Snowman Gift.png|75px|Snowman Gift|link=Snowman Gift]]\n|[[File:Blue Woolly Hat.png|75px|Blue Woolly Hat|link=Blue Woolly Hat]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 10 minutes to make a gift. Each treat gives players 80 experience points.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 gift per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat. Each gift used on a boat will be rewarded with 10 [[holly]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Geschenk mit Tupfen\n|es = Regalo de lunares\n}}\n[[Category:Gift Wrapping Station Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Popcorn Products]]\n[[Category:Cherry Products]]\n[[Category:Egg Products]]",
